sidore Barbarin","x":"Giovanni."},{"p":0,"b":146,"s":"INTERVIEWER","x":"Giovanni. Yeah. Uh-huh."},{"p":0,"b":147,"s":"INTERVIEWER (SPEAKER_03)","x":"Did they use the little E-flat clarinet or the big clarinet? The little E-flat or the big one?"},{"p":0,"b":148,"s":"Isidore Barbarin","x":"Yeah, E-flat and B-flat. Both. Yeah."},{"p":0,"b":149,"s":"INTERVIEWER","x":"So you can hear him?"},{"p":0,"b":150,"s":"Isidore Barbarin","x":"Some fellows, they come down with E-flat, you know? Some come down with B-flat."},{"p":0,"b":151,"s":"INTERVIEWER","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":0,"b":152,"s":"INTERVIEWER (SPEAKER_03)","x":"What about baritone horns?"},{"p":0,"b":153,"s":"INTERVIEWER","x":"What about baritone horns?"},{"p":0,"b":154,"s":"Isidore Barbarin","x":"Huh?"},{"p":0,"b":155,"s":"INTERVIEWER","x":"Baritone. Baritone horns."},{"p":0,"b":156,"s":"Isidore Barbarin","x":"I don't know what you say."},{"p":0,"b":157,"s":"INTERVIEWER","x":"Baritone."},{"p":0,"b":158,"s":"Isidore Barbarin","x":"The horn, they call it baritone. Oh, baritone, yeah. I got that. Baritone wasn't so much, you know? It was the baritone part very difficult, you know? Uh-huh. And they didn't bother with that much. Some of them, they had barit one or two playing."},{"p":0,"b":159,"s":"INTERVIEWER (SPEAKER_03)","x":"Ask him if this was..."},{"p":0,"b":160,"s":"Isidore Barbarin","x":"Could give satisfaction."}]}